{"id":"654789","name":"酱萝卜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654789/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"一头"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"4个"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜不用去皮，切去头尾部分。","img":"images/654789/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成4半。","img":"images/654789/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再切成连刀片。","img":"images/654789/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撒入白糖杀水，口感更脆更好吃。","img":"images/654789/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌均匀，放置一个小时。","img":"images/654789/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下来的时间做酱汁，准备配料，蒜、小米椒、青椒。","img":"images/654789/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蒜切片，辣椒切圈。","img":"images/654789/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切好的配料放入大碗内，倒入酱油、陈醋、饮用水和白砂糖搅拌均匀，酱汁就做好了。","img":"images/654789/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间过去快一个小时，萝卜已杀出好多水分。","img":"images/654789/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把水分挤干。","img":"images/654789/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"萝卜放入干净的容器内。","img":"images/654789/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入酱汁。","img":"images/654789/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"酱汁淹没萝卜表面。","img":"images/654789/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"密封好，十个小时后可食用。","img":"images/654789/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。酸甜脆爽，非常开胃。","img":"images/654789/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}